      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "They advertised on posters outside the stadium to promise that every competitor is to have a regular physical examination in a gymnasium one after another. No one can bargain on this. The volunteers in charge will be very strict.",
        "zh": "他们在体育场外张贴海报，承诺每一位参赛者，都要在体育馆接受常规身体检查，一个接一个地接受检查。任何人都不能对此讨价还价。负责此事的志愿者会十分严格。",
        "start": 98.21333333333334,
        "voiceEnd": 117.92666666666668,
